<title>LEBANON: Tremor hits Beirut, coastal city.</title>
<headline>Tremor hits Beirut, coastal city.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>A small tremor hit Beirut and a southern Lebanese coastal city on Tuesday night, residents said.</p>
<p>Residents in the capital and the southern port of Sidon said the tremor at about 9:50 p.m. (19:50 GMT) moved furniture and objects in their homes. The magnitude of the tremor was not immediately known.</p>
